---
import Layout from '../../layouts/Layout.astro';
---
<Layout
  title="Proyectos | XHub — X4yi"
  description="Directorio de proyectos de X4yi: ModularVoiceX4yi (MVX), X4UI Framework (GUI para Minecraft Forge 1.12.2) y LethalWeaponry Mod."
  keywords="X4yi, x4ui, ModularVoiceX4yi, MVX, PipeWire voice changer, X4UI Framework, LethalWeaponry, Minecraft mod, Forge 1.12.2"
>
  <main class="container">
    <header class="section-header">
        <h1>
            <span data-i18n="es">Proyectos</span>
            <span data-i18n="en">Projects</span>
        </h1>
        <p>
            <span data-i18n="es">Directorio de herramientas, frameworks y mods desarrollados por X4yi.</span>
            <span data-i18n="en">Directory of tools, frameworks, and mods developed by X4yi.</span>
        </p>
    </header>
    <div class="card-grid">
        <div class="project-card">
            <span class="project-tag">Linux / PipeWire / Rust</span>
            <h2>ModularVoiceX4yi (MVX)</h2>
            <p>
                <span data-i18n="es">Estudio vocal modular en tiempo real sobre PipeWire. Incluye rack DSP de ultra baja latencia (&lt;15 ms), supresión neuronal de ruido (DeepFilterNet3), biometría vocal (CAM++) y clonación neuronal de timbre (OpenVoice V2).</span>
                <span data-i18n="en">Real-time modular vocal studio powered by PipeWire. Features an ultra-low-latency DSP rack (&lt;15 ms), neural noise suppression (DeepFilterNet3), vocal biometrics (CAM++), and neural timbre cloning (OpenVoice V2).</span>
            </p>
            <div class="project-links">
                <a href="/xhub/docs/modularvoicex4yi/00-overview/" class="external-link">Docs &rarr;</a>
                <a href="/xhub/changelogs/modularvoicex4yi/" class="external-link">Changelogs &rarr;</a>
                <a href="https://github.com/X4yii/ModularVoiceX4yi" target="_blank" class="external-link">GitHub &rarr;</a>
            </div>
        </div>
        <div class="project-card">
            <span class="project-tag">Framework / Forge 1.12.2</span>
            <h2>X4UI Framework</h2>
            <p>
                <span data-i18n="es">Framework moderno de interfaz gráfica de modo retenido para Minecraft Forge 1.12.2. Incluye layouts FlexBox, árbol de componentes DOM, tipografía vectorial TrueType, estados reactivos y reproducción de video Zero-Copy.</span>
                <span data-i18n="en">A modern, high-performance retained-mode GUI framework for Minecraft Forge 1.12.2. Includes FlexBox layouts, DOM component tree, TrueType vector typography, reactive state, and Zero-Copy video playback.</span>
            </p>
            <div class="project-links">
                <a href="/xhub/docs/x4ui/getting-started/" class="external-link">Docs &rarr;</a>
                <a href="/xhub/changelogs/x4ui/" class="external-link">Changelogs &rarr;</a>
                <a href="https://github.com/X4yii/x4ui" target="_blank" class="external-link">GitHub &rarr;</a>
            </div>
        </div>
        <div class="project-card">
            <span class="project-tag">Minecraft Mod / Forge 1.12.2</span>
            <h2>LethalWeaponry</h2>
            <p>
                <span data-i18n="es">Expansión de combate para Minecraft Forge 1.12.2 con 4 arquetipos de armas (WarHammer, Katana, Scythe, Chain Blade), mecánicas activas, encantamientos exclusivos y sincronización multijugador completa.</span>
                <span data-i18n="en">A Minecraft Forge 1.12.2 combat overhaul featuring 4 weapon types (WarHammer, Katana, Scythe, Chain Blade) with unique mechanics, advanced capabilities, and fully synced multiplayer networking.</span>
            </p>
            <div class="project-links">
                <a href="/xhub/docs/lethalweaponry/00-introduction/00-overview/" class="external-link">Docs &rarr;</a>
                <a href="/xhub/changelogs/lethalweaponry/" class="external-link">Changelogs &rarr;</a>
                <a href="https://github.com/X4yii/Lethalweaponry" target="_blank" class="external-link">GitHub &rarr;</a>
                <a href="https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/lethalweaponry" target="_blank" class="external-link">CurseForge &rarr;</a>
                <a href="https://modrinth.com/mod/lethalweaponryy" target="_blank" class="external-link">Modrinth &rarr;</a>
            </div>
        </div>
        <div class="project-card">
            <span class="project-tag">CleanroomMC 0.6.X–0.7.X / Java 21+</span>
            <h2>Automata</h2>
            <p>
                <span data-i18n="es">Agentes autónomos tipo jugador para Minecraft 1.12.2 (CleanroomMC) con pathfinding 3D asíncrono, combate táctico, escuadrones, AutomaStaff e interfaz X4UI.</span>
                <span data-i18n="en">Autonomous player-like agents for Minecraft 1.12.2 (CleanroomMC) featuring async 3D pathfinding, tactical combat, squads, AutomaStaff, and X4UI panels.</span>
            </p>
            <div class="project-links">
                <a href="/xhub/docs/automata/00-introduction/00-overview/" class="external-link">Docs &rarr;</a>
                <a href="/xhub/changelogs/automata/" class="external-link">Changelogs &rarr;</a>
            </div>
        </div>
    </div>
  </main>
</Layout>
<style>
  .container { max-width: 1100px; margin: 4rem auto; padding: 0 2rem; min-height: 70vh; }
  .section-header { margin-bottom: 3rem; }
  h1 { color: var(--text-primary); font-size: 3rem; margin-bottom: 0.5rem; letter-spacing: -0.03em; }
  p { color: var(--text-secondary); font-size: 1.1rem; }
  .card-grid {
      display: grid;
      grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fill, minmax(320px, 1fr));
      gap: 1.5rem;
  }
  .project-card {
      display: flex;
      flex-direction: column;
      padding: 1.5rem;
      background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.03);
      border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.05);
      border-radius: 12px;
      text-decoration: none;
      transition: all 0.2s ease;
  }
  .project-card:hover {
      background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.05);
      border-color: var(--accent-projects);
      transform: translateY(-4px);
  }
  .project-tag {
      font-size: 0.75rem;
      font-weight: 700;
      text-transform: uppercase;
      color: var(--accent-projects);
      letter-spacing: 0.05em;
      margin-bottom: 0.5rem;
      display: inline-block;
  }
  .project-card h2 {
      color: var(--text-primary);
      font-size: 1.5rem;
      margin-bottom: 0.75rem;
  }
  .project-card p {
      font-size: 0.95rem;
      margin-bottom: 1.5rem;
      line-height: 1.6;
  }
  .project-links {
      display: flex;
      flex-wrap: wrap;
      gap: 1rem;
      margin-top: auto;
  }
  .external-link {
      font-size: 0.85rem;
      font-weight: 700;
      color: var(--accent-projects);
      text-decoration: none;
      transition: color 0.2s;
  }
  .external-link:hover {
      color: white;
  }

  @media (max-width: 768px) {
    .container { padding: 0 1rem; margin: 2rem auto; }
    h1 { font-size: 2.2rem; }
    .card-grid { grid-template-columns: 1fr; }
    .project-links { flex-direction: column; }
  }
</style>
